The above MIT license covers the source code only.

`server/src/data/venues.json` is a derived database produced from
OpenStreetMap data via the Overpass API. OpenStreetMap data is
© OpenStreetMap contributors and licensed under the Open Database License
(ODbL) v1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any redistribution of that file, or of a database derived from it, remains
subject to ODbL (including its share-alike requirement). Attribution is
carried inside the file itself and displayed in the application UI.

`server/src/data/venues.json` 為 OpenStreetMap 衍生資料庫，
仍受 ODbL 規範（含相同方式分享條款），與本專案程式碼的 MIT 授權分開適用。
